From 74804ca4686a63c414bf6d27cec8b77be6f22e83 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:01:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(gate): select fixture readers and importer checks

Add fixture directory readers to the quick plan across crates.
Run independent STEP and feature-edge checks after importer changes.
Pin the selection with real repository cases and small fixtures.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2740
